              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ರಂಗಭೂಮಿ (raṅgabhūmi) is a learned compound built from Sanskrit raṅga, \"a place of public amusement, a stage\" (CDIAL 10561), and bhūmi, \"earth, ground\" (CDIAL 9557)."
